A '''Shiny Token''' is a {{Rare}} item.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Shiny Token''' is a guaranteed drop from {{MobSprite|Shiny Pig;Shiny Pigs}}.

== Usage ==
'''Shiny Tokens''' can be used to purchase items from {{NPCSprite|Piggy}}.
{{:Piggy/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*'''Shiny Tokens''' were initially added as part of {{RankName|Pig|Technoblade}}'s Mayor perks, due to his position as a [[Resistance Leader]] following [[The Uprising]].
**'''Shiny Tokens''' later gained more uses when {{RankName|YouTube|MrFaceplate}}, {{RankName|Pig|Technoblade}}'s father, became a [[Minister Election|Minister]] for {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} to craft the {{Item|Blood God Sigil}} and {{Item|Potato Ring}}.

